    summary: 'Weight quantization replaces BF16 or FP16 parameters with lower-precision representations plus scale factors. Weight-only schemes (W4A16, W8A16) dequantize on the fly and keep activations in high precision; weight-and-activation schemes (W8A8, FP8) also quantize activations so the matmul itself runs on low-precision tensor cores.',
